The most recent version of the Mercedes-Benz CLS 350 with a V6 engine is from the C218 generation (2011-2018), specifically the CLS 350 BlueEFFICIENCY or CLS 350. The facelifted models (2014-2018) are the most recent within this generation. I will use data primarily from the 2014-2018 C218 CLS 350 (V6 petrol).

- **price\_usd**: The CLS 350 V6 is from an older generation (C218, 2011-2018). Used prices are significantly lower than the average new car price. Used examples from 2012-2017 are listed around €13,950 - €29,999 in Europe (~$15,100 - $32,400 USD). A 2011 model is listed around $19,900 - $22,100 AUD (~$13,100 - $14,500 USD). This is well below the market average of ~$52,000. Score: +0.80.
